    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 1v1.3v3 multiplayer online shooting game where victory in each round is achieved by the number of kills. There are a total of 7 rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game duration: The total duration of one game is approximately 10 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: Win by killing enemies. The default damage of weapons in the game is 35 points. If you get close to the small yellow squares on the map, the weapon damage will increase to 70 points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introduction: There are two teams in the game, the blue team and the red team, with 3 players on each side.</p>",
